              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"tr-page-hero\"><span class=\"tr-label\">Get in touch<\/span><h1>Contact Us To Get Better Information<\/h1><p>If you have a question about us or our training courses, please send us a message using the form below. We usually respond to email requests within 48 hours.<\/p><\/div>"
